{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"g1","type":"group","x":-440,"y":-200,"width":2360,"height":400,"label":"1. Ekstraksi Dinamika 2 Hz & Tahap 1 KNN (Bab III Subbab 3.2 - 3.3.1)"},
		{"id":"g2","type":"group","x":-440,"y":340,"width":2360,"height":360,"label":"2. Tahap 2: Dynamic Trajectory Alignment & Penalti BJC (Bab III Subbab 3.3.2)"},
		{"id":"g3","type":"group","x":-440,"y":940,"width":2360,"height":290,"label":" "},
		{"id":"n3","type":"text","text":"### 3. Interpolasi Waypoint\n`[Bab III 3.3.1, Eq. 3.1]`\n\n- Input $\\mathbf{p}_{\\mathrm{start}}$, $\\mathbf{p}_{\\mathrm{target}}$, panjang $M$\n- Hitung $M$ titik acuan linier:\n  $$\\mathbf{w}_j = \\mathbf{p}_{\\mathrm{start}} + \\frac{j-1}{M-1}(\\mathbf{p}_{\\mathrm{target}} - \\mathbf{p}_{\\mathrm{start}})$$","x":810,"y":-150,"width":340,"height":215,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"n1","type":"text","text":"### 1. Time-Series DEAM 2 Hz\n`[Bab III 3.2]`\n\n- 1.802 klip audio (45 detik)\n- Buang 15s awal (transien)\n- Ambil **30s stabil** (detik 15–45, **60 timestamp**)","x":-400,"y":-150,"width":330,"height":215,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"n2","type":"text","text":"### 2. Ekstraksi Intro & Outro\n`[Bab III 3.3.2, Eq. 3.3]`\n\n- **Intro** $\\mathbf{p}_{\\mathrm{intro},k}$: rata-rata 6 titik awal (15–18s)\n- **Outro** $\\mathbf{p}_{\\mathrm{outro},k}$: rata-rata 6 titik akhir (42–45s)\n- Vektor $\\vec{\\mathbf{t}}_k = \\mathbf{p}_{\\mathrm{outro}} - \\mathbf{p}_{\\mathrm{intro}}$ & $\\theta_k$","x":180,"y":-150,"width":340,"height":250,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"n4","type":"text","text":"### 4. Tahap 1: KNN Retrieval\n`[Bab III 3.3.1, Eq. 3.2]`\n\n- Query KD-Tree pada $\\bar{\\mathbf{p}}_k$\n- Hitung $d_{\\mathrm{target}}(\\mathbf{w}_j, \\bar{\\mathbf{p}}_k) = \\|\\mathbf{w}_j - \\bar{\\mathbf{p}}_k\\|_2$\n- Ambil **$K = 20$ kandidat** terdekat","x":1480,"y":-150,"width":320,"height":215,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n9","type":"text","text":"### 9. Seleksi Kandidat Terbaik\n\n- Pilih kandidat $L_k^*$ dengan **Score terendah**\n- Dekat waypoint + searah lintasan + sambungan *outro-intro* halus","x":40,"y":990,"width":350,"height":215,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n5","type":"text","text":"### 5. Vektor Target Lintasan\n`[Bab III 3.3.2, Eq. 3.4]`\n\n- Arah perubahan emosi yang diharapkan antar-waypoint:\n  $$\\vec{\\mathbf{u}}_j = \\mathbf{w}_j - \\mathbf{w}_{j-1}$$\n- Menjadi acuan arah gerak lagu","x":-340,"y":378,"width":340,"height":250,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n11","type":"text","text":"### 11. Output Playlist Mood-Arc\n\n- Siap dievaluasi dengan metrik $\\mathcal{S}$, $\\mathcal{E}$, $\\mathcal{CBJC}$ & *Blind A/B*","x":1060,"y":990,"width":310,"height":215,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n10","type":"text","text":"### 10. Iterasi Posisi j = 1..M\n\n- Simpan $L_k^*$ ke playlist\n- Ulangi untuk waypoint $\\mathbf{w}_{j+1}$ hingga panjang $M \\in \\{5, 10, 15\\}$","x":540,"y":990,"width":340,"height":215,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n6","type":"text","text":"### 6. Penyelarasan Arah Trajektori\n`[Bab III 3.3.2, Eq. 3.5]`\n\n- Cosine similarity antara gerak internal lagu $\\vec{\\mathbf{t}}_k$ & arah lintasan $\\vec{\\mathbf{u}}_j$:\n  $$\\mathrm{Sim}_{\\mathrm{traj}} = \\frac{\\vec{\\mathbf{t}}_k \\cdot \\vec{\\mathbf{u}}_j}{\\|\\vec{\\mathbf{t}}_k\\|_2 \\|\\vec{\\mathbf{u}}_j\\|_2} \\in [-1, +1]$$","x":180,"y":391,"width":360,"height":225,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"n7","type":"text","text":"### 7. Penalti Boundary Jump Cost\n`[Bab III 3.3.2, Eq. 3.6 — Wang 2024 REMAST]`\n\n- Jarak fisik antara penutup lagu sebelumnya $L_{j-1}$ & pembuka kandidat $L_k$:\n  $$\\mathcal{BJC}(L_{j-1}, L_k) = \\|\\mathbf{p}_{\\mathrm{outro}}(L_{j-1}) - \\mathbf{p}_{\\mathrm{intro}}(L_k)\\|_2$$","x":705,"y":391,"width":350,"height":225,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"n8","type":"text","text":"### 8. Skor Komposit Reranker\n`[Bab III 3.3.2, Eq. 3.7]`\n\n- Gabung 3 komponen dengan bobot $w_1 + w_2 + w_3 = 1$:\n  - Jarak waypoint ($w_1$)\n  - Ketidakselarasan arah ($w_2$)\n  - Penalti $\\mathcal{BJC}$ ($w_3$)","x":1520,"y":359,"width":280,"height":290,"color":"4"}
	],
